{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_039D80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你了解战俘收容所的情况吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他们征用了整个村子，把那里改成了收容所。巷子错综复杂，要留意巡逻兵的动向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我可不想和他们迎面撞上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过如果善用那些巷子，反过来也能躲开敌人的视线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那Chico在哪里？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"应该被关在某间屋子里。从门口往里看，确认一下里面。出现图标后，按<I=ACT>就行。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<I=ACT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"屋里的动静也许能提供线索。仔细听听。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我试试。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"你窥视屋内的时候，周围的巡逻也不会停。别被敌人发现。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Snake……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我知道。我会尽全力把Chico救出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"谢谢。靠你了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""}]}